    {
      "text": "許多人知道如何在 Mac 上使用 <kbd>Command<kbd> + <kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>3</kbd> 進行全螢幕截圖，以及使用 <kbd>4</kbd> 進行十字游標選擇工具來將螢幕截圖到檔案。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "capture-screen-into-clipboard-instead-of-file-on-mac",
        "title": "在 Mac 上將螢幕截圖到剪貼簿而不是檔案",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/capture-screen-into-clipboard-instead-of-file-on-mac/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然而，我發現我更想直接將截取的圖像貼到編輯器中，而不是將圖像儲存到檔案。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "capture-screen-into-clipboard-instead-of-file-on-mac",
        "title": "在 Mac 上將螢幕截圖到剪貼簿而不是檔案",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/capture-screen-into-clipboard-instead-of-file-on-mac/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "將螢幕截圖到剪貼簿的快速鍵非常不方便，即 <kbd>Control</kbd> + <kbd>Command</kbd> + <kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>3</kbd> 或 <kbd>4</kbd>。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "capture-screen-into-clipboard-instead-of-file-on-mac",
        "title": "在 Mac 上將螢幕截圖到剪貼簿而不是檔案",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/capture-screen-into-clipboard-instead-of-file-on-mac/"
      }
    },
    {
